# Fog: "Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn." Bot1 attacks with Guerrilla Gorilla and Llanowar
# Elves; Bot2 blocks the Gorilla with its own and casts Fog in the declare blockers step. All three creatures' combat
# damage is prevented (CR 615.1): Bot2 stays at 20 and neither Gorilla is damaged, and each prevention is recorded as
# Fog's. Damage that is not combat damage is not prevented: Bot2's Lightning Bolt after combat kills the Elves. The effect
# lasts only this turn (CR 514.2): on turn 5 the Gorilla attacks again and deals its 2.

