Mox Jet
Guerrilla Gorilla
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Guerrilla Gorilla
Fog
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

